   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "indem and zumal",
     "texto": [
      "**indem** introduces the means by which a goal is reached and moves the conjugated verb to the absolute end: **Man spart Energie, indem man weniger heizt** (you save energy by heating less).",
      "**zumal** introduces an explanatory reinforcing causality that presupposes or adds a weighty motive: **Wir sollten handeln, zumal die Zeit drängt** (we should act, especially since time is pressing). Both connectors structure formal institutional discourse."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Connector",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Syntactic and semantic function",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Formal example",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
